  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO&apos;s leading role in education recognized at the UNHQs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In preparation to the Summit of the Future and the World Social Summit, UN is looking for accelerating progress on the implementation of all SDGs, in particular through transforming education. Targeted advocacy on UNESCO&apos;s leading role for the implementation of the education goals at global level will be ensured. NYO will leverage its convening power to ascertain the centrality of education in new intergovernmental agreements, including the Pact for the Future and the Outcome document of the World Social Summit. New York Office will ensure increased visibility of the Organization&apos;s priorities in education, as it will drive forward its advocacy efforts at the UNHQs. It will establish closer synergies between the SDG 4 High Level Steering Committee with the UN forums such as the UN General Assembly, High Level Political Forum, ECOSOC and others.</narrative>
  </description>
